    "body": "And then be careful that nobody ever imports utils by mistake if sparse exists. I believe it should not be called utils right ? As it might contain other things and if it contained the fake definition of SparseArray would prevent people from using it unless sparse is not installed. Maybe have a fake_sparse.py file with just this empty class definition and nothing else but then you just created an indirection and had to add a comment to explain what it meant for something that I could see immediately in the first case.",
